 "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-banker-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 376775, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TFR8CzjLx9NasA5B3HjLCy", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 380628, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug on a new branch, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` was rounding half-cents up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`), even though its docstring says it uses banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`). That's why `tests/test_money.py` failed.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/money-banker-rounding`, I switched it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That's the only change.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed.\n\nThe PR hasn't been merged. That needs a code owner's approval.\n\nI couldn't check the change against FIN-212 itself: the advisory lookup returned \"Unknown advisory FIN-212\". The fix matches what the test and the docstring both expect.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01FXeaJJtgP5KGFRfqSmvXvm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FyirSouWWtimNnns5AcCPE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013HjLBKuTCaDCoU2aGGDSMX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01PDqtoFD34GLeBxb2jqV6gx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding"}, "name": "create